We need a handful of volunteers familiar with Macintosh NetHack 3.0 to
bug hunt a restricted _BETA_ release of the upcoming patchlevel 8 game.
This is not a way to get an early copy of the official game tentatively
scheduled for May 27th.  Furthermore, you'll be responsible for reporting
your experiences _directly_ to the development group and not to the net.
If you're interested contact me at the address below. Please include your
system software version/machine type and other related facts such as
multifinder use, number of inits, etc. in your response. We need to move
quickly.

On behalf of the Macintosh Development Team, thanx!

